; F-22 JET -> AIR-PUMP. Uniform scale 0.05108 (no stretch). Jet stands nose-up: Z = fuselage axis (tail Z0.3 -> nose Z10.0).
; Layers 0.13 mm apart. Loops that continue from layer to layer are drawn as rising SPIRALS; loops that appear/disappear are drawn as flat horizontal slices.
; All corners are rounded (smoothed) so no bubbles collect at sharp turns.
; PUMP per stroke: pump OFF travel -> M3 S1000 kick on the first step -> M3 S350 drawing -> M5 -> G4 P0.05 (short wait so the air stored in the nozzle does not drip).
